{"format":1,"key":"npc:iverron","path":"/lore/npc/iverron","name":"Iverron","kind":"npc","label":"Character","zone":{"key":"teldrassil","name":"Teldrassil","path":"/lore/zone/teldrassil"},"levels":"","description":"In Shadowglen, Iverron lies stricken by spider venom. His plight warns of growing corruption within Teldrassil.","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"npc:iverron","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["In Shadowglen, Iverron lies stricken by spider venom. His plight warns of growing corruption within Teldrassil.","Iverron wandered beneath Shadowglen’s quiet canopies when webwood spiders bit him. Their venom left the young night elf unable to return to safety on his own. The spiders once shared the glade in peace, but now they grow increasingly aggressive."],"hash":"05c83a","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"74ac4d3d56","sec":21},"female-narrator":{"sha":"c54597f66f","sec":24}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Iverron","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Iverron"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/quest/3521-iverrons-antidote","n":"Iverron's Antidote","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/3519-a-friend-in-need","n":"A Friend in Need","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/4495-a-good-friend","n":"A Good Friend","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/shadowglen","n":"Shadowglen","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/zone/teldrassil","n":"Teldrassil","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/topic/night-elf","n":"Night elf","k":"topic"},{"p":"/lore/npc/tarindrella","n":"Tarindrella","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/dirania-silvershine","n":"Dirania Silvershine","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/quest/3522-iverrons-antidote","n":"Iverron's Antidote","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/item/hyacinth-mushroom","n":"Hyacinth Mushroom","k":"item"},{"p":"/lore/item/iverron-s-antidote-item","n":"Iverron's Antidote (item)","k":"item"},{"p":"/lore/item/moonpetal-lily","n":"Moonpetal Lily","k":"item"}],"wowhead":"npc=8584"}
